Subject: remotesmith(0105): placeholder RemoteSmith icons

Two overlapping screens on a dark rounded square, generated by
scripts/branding/gen-placeholder-icons.py in the RemoteSmith repo: macOS
AppIcon.icns and tray template, Windows app/tray .ico, Flutter in-app
icon.svg, res/ PNGs and SVGs. A placeholder until a real logo exists.

Plan: DEC-15, AC-33.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
